## Error Summary Extraction
Extract meaningful error information from Gradle output:

```python
def _extract_error_summary(gradle_output: str) -> str:
    lines = gradle_output.splitlines()
    error_lines = [
        line for line in lines
        if any(pattern in line.lower() for pattern in [
            "failed", "error", "exception", "assertion",
            "could not resolve", "compilation failed"
        ])
    ]
    return "\n".join(error_lines[:10])
```

